    "en": {
      "trackName": "Wristbox - Watch Games",
      "description": "Wristbox brings quick games to iPhone and Apple Watch. The game collection continues to grow.\n\nGames available now:\n\n• Upward Hop: Climb between alternating platforms.\n• Rightward Hop: Judge each gap and land in the center for more points.\n• Downward Hop: Spin the tower, slip through gaps, and avoid red blocks.\n• Platform Hop: Chase a high score in Classic, score in 60-second Arcade, or race through Daily Ten.\n• Stacking Hop: Time your jumps and build a taller tower.\n• Sphere Snake: Eat oranges around a planet, grow longer, and avoid your own body.\n• Ball Rolling: Steer left and right, dodge blocks, and grab coins as you roll from dusk into night.\n\nGame features:\n\n• Play free on iPhone, with no ads.\n• Clean visuals and intuitive controls make it easy to jump in.\n• Designed for the Apple Watch screen and touch controls.\n• Optimized for iPhone Duo: unfold to play full screen and see more of each game.\n• Play games offline.\n• Supports global Game Center leaderboards.\n\nAuto-renewable subscription information:\n\n• Plans: All Games Monthly (1 month) and Yearly (1 year) provide unlimited Watch play while active.\n• Price and payment: See the localized price in the app. Apple charges your account when you confirm the purchase.\n• Renewal: Subscriptions renew automatically unless canceled. Apple may attempt renewal during the 24 hours before expiry.\n• Cancellation: Manage subscriptions in iPhone Settings → Apple Account → Subscriptions. Cancel at least 24 hours before expiry to avoid the next renewal. Access continues until the current paid period ends.\n• Terms of Use: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\n• Privacy Policy: https://sites.google.com/view/wanbox",
      "releaseNotes": "Fixed Game Center sign-in and improved leaderboards.",
